Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(verify): gate 2c measures unit+db coverage; baseline
 re-recorded with its measure [T-0128]

What changed:
- scripts/agent/verify.sh gate 2c (in the lead's WIP save 47ab51e, validated here): runs
  `VITEST_MAX_WORKERS=1 pnpm -s exec vitest run --project unit --project db --coverage...`
  (measure "unit+db", one worker pinned). Compares total line % with .agent/coverage-baseline.json
  on origin/main (else main). If main's baseline was taken with another measure (no "measure"
  field = old unit-only), the gate is PENDING and asks for a re-record on main. It never compares
  across measures.
- scripts/agent/test/scripts.test.ts: four new 'verify.sh (full) with a task: 2c coverage ...'
  tests (fake pnpm on PATH): unit+db + one worker + PASS, FAIL on a drop, PENDING on a legacy or
  'unit' main baseline even if the branch has its own baseline, PENDING with no baseline.
- .agent/coverage-baseline.json re-recorded with the gate's exact command over bcf4ab6:
  measure unit+db, lines 93.65 (8071/8618), branches 79.21, functions 95.66,
  statements 91.09; records command, date, commit and evidence path. The old unit-only values
  are kept in its note.
- Docs: definition-of-done gate 2c wording; RQ-0105 answered with resolution; DL-0410, DL-0411;
  T-0128 card (steps 1-2, AC-2, new AC-3 ticked; AC-1 waits for the baseline on main) and backlog
  index row and counts.
- Evidence in .agent/evidence/T-0128/: RED and GREEN agent-test output, the coverage run summary
  and the per-package unit+db breakdown.

Why: The owner approved RQ-0105 remedy 2 (DL-0408). Unit-only coverage counts DB-tested modules
as uncovered. The RED run showed that, without a measure check, the new measure would have
passed silently against the 72.22 % unit-only baseline.

Validation:
- RED: node --test --test-name-pattern="2c coverage" -> 4 fail (old gate: --project unit only,
  "PASS (lines 94.1% vs main 72.22%)"). GREEN: 5/5 pass.
- node --test scripts/agent/test/*.test.ts -> 100 pass, 0 fail, 0 skipped, 0 todo.
- Gate command over bcf4ab6 -> 160 files / 2195 tests passed, 0 skipped (local PG 16), exit 0.
- bash scripts/agent/verify.sh --quick --task T-0128 -> PASS 10, FAIL 0, PENDING 6 (all
  "--quick" skips); typecheck, lint, format:check, pnpm test all PASS.
- Full verify.sh (real gate 2c) not yet run at this commit; it follows next.

Next action: run full `bash scripts/agent/verify.sh --task T-0128`. Expected 2c is PENDING
(main still holds the unit-only baseline). The lead merges the branch. After the baseline is on
main, re-run verify (2c should PASS, AC-1), then Codex cross-review.

